Package: porelo-ecosystem-maven
Version: [[package.version]]
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Michael Schnell <michael@fuin.org>
Homepage: https://github.com/porelo-ai/porelo-ecosystems
Description: Recognizes what a Maven checkout needs, for Porelo
 Installs one program under /usr/libexec/porelo/ecosystems, where the porelo
 binary finds its build-tool plugins. It reads a checkout's poms and the
 person's Maven settings, runs no project code and opens no connection.
